@* Displays the render mode the component is currently running in.
   Under global static SSR with per-page interactivity you can observe a page
   transition from "Static" (prerender) to its interactive mode ("Server" or
   "WebAssembly"). In the MAUI Blazor Hybrid app it always reports the hybrid
   WebView renderer, because Blazor Hybrid is always interactive. *@

<div class="render-mode-indicator alert alert-secondary py-2 my-2" role="status">
    <small>
        Rendered by <strong>@RendererInfo.Name</strong>
        &middot; interactive: <strong>@RendererInfo.IsInteractive</strong>
        @if (AssignedRenderMode is not null)
        {
            <text> &middot; assigned render mode: <strong>@AssignedRenderMode.GetType().Name</strong></text>
        }
    </small>
</div>
